  "description": "Adele who became a new hunter on behalf of her sick uncle!  \nFirst day of battle! Kidnapped by a human-eating wolf, Carl!\n\nNo, but this human-eating wolf is a little weird?!  \nIsn't he a human-eating wolf?\n\nHe's the only one who comes down as a legend.  \nAn ancient wolf who could use magic!  \nAnd also their prince?\n\nBut why do I have to be your pet?!  \nAs a human being with dignity.  \nI'm just with you as a little bit of good faith?\n\nAgainst Tristan, a \"dark wolf\" who's driving the world into darkness  \nThe wolf who tries to save the world, the sword, and how he became his pet  \nAdele's world of cutie fantasy romance!\n\nCan they save the world?  \nAnd will Adele be able to escape Carl's pet status? (Papago)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EB%8A%91%EB%8C%80-%EB%8C%80%EA%B3%B5%EC%9D%98-%EB%B0%98%EB%A0%A4%EC%9D%B8%EA%B0%84/2778), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60847636)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/150570)",
